  "description": "<blockquote data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3048\"><strong data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3046\">Steam Link | als nieuw in doos | compleet & origineel</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3229\">Stream je PC-games eenvoudig naar je tv met deze originele <strong data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3128\">Steam Link</strong>. Dit exemplaar is in <strong data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3165\">topconditie</strong>, compleet geleverd met originele doos, kabels en handleiding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3276\"><strong data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3274\">Waarom dit een waardevolle set is:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3602\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3364\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3364\">Origineel Valve-apparaat — de hardwareversie is niet meer geproduceerd sinds 2018</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3425\">Plug-and-play streaming via netwerk (ethernet of wifi)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3484\">HDMI-uitgang + USB-poorten voor controllerconnecties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3565\">Perfect voor gamers die hun PC-library willen benutten op een groot scherm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3598\"><strong>Inclusief 1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3633\"><strong data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3631\">Technische highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3896\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3650\">Model 1003</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3718\">4 GB opslag, 256 MB RAM </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3808\">3 USB-2.0 poorten, HDMI output, ethernetpoort </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3896\">Wifi 802.11ac & fast ethernet ondersteuning </p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</blockquote>",
